@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki.integration"

Feature:  Koroneiki to Provisioning External Link Integration
	Testing to assure that koroneiki account external links transfer properly to the account details page.

Teardown:
	* I wait for "10" seconds
	* I tear down the teams on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Partner |
	| Updated Partner   |
	* I tear down the team roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Partner |
	* I tear down the external links for the product "A Liferay DXP Product" on koroneiki with the following entity id values
	| A Liferay DXP Product |
	* I tear down the external links for the product "Platinum Subscription" on koroneiki with the following entity id values
	| Platinum Subscription |
	* I tear down the external links for the product "Gold Subscription" on koroneiki with the following entity id values
	| Gold Subscription |
	* I tear down the external links for the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" on koroneiki with the following entity id values
	| 1234 |
	* I tear down the external links for the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" on koroneiki with the following entity id and domain values
	| ${staticDossieraAccountKey}   | salesforce |
	| ${staticDossieraAccountKey}   | dossiera   |
	| ${staticSalesforceProjectKey} | salesforce |
	* I tear down the product purchases on koroneiki made by the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" for the following products
	| A Liferay DXP Product  |
	| Platinum Subscription  |
	* I tear down the product purchases on koroneiki made by the account "Onepro - ${staticCompanyName}" for the following products
	| A Liferay DXP Product  |
	| Platinum Subscription  |
	* I tear down the products on koroneiki with the following names
	| A Liferay DXP Product |
	| Platinum Subscription |
	* I tear down the contact roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Liferay Account Customer Role |
 	* I tear down the contacts on koroneiki with the following email addresses
	| pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Korpro - ${staticCompanyName} |
	| Onepro - ${staticCompanyName} |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following "Code" values
	| KORPROKORPRO |
	| ONEPROONEPRO |
	* I teardown the tickets with the following keywords from zendesk.liferay.com
	| Korpro - ${staticCompanyName} |

Scenario: View external link
	Testing the ability to create a platinum subcription in Dossiera and adding an external link and viewing the external link in the provisioning account details page 

	Given I generate several static variables for Provisioning
	And I generate a provisioning company name
	And I generate a provisioning project name
	And I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message on sandbox with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
	| Account Name                           | Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}              |
	| Address City                           | Diamond Bar                                |
	| Address Country                        | United States                              |
	| Address Postal Code                    | 91765                                      |
	| Address Region                         | California                                 |
	| Address Street                         | 456 Fake Street                            |
	| Contact Email Address                  | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Contact First Name                     | PRO                                        |
	| Contact Last Name                      | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Contact Role                           | Liferay Account Customer Role              |
	| Dossiera Account Key                   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey}                |
	| Dossiera Address Key 1                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey1}               |
	| Dossiera Address Key 2                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey2}               |
	| Dossiera Contact Key                   | ${staticDossieraContactKey}                |
	| Dossiera Project Key                   | ${staticDossieraProjectKey}                |
	| End Day                                | ${staticEndDay}                            |
	| End Month                              | ${staticEndMonth}                          |
	| End Year                               | ${staticEndYear}                           |
	| Industry                               | Automotive                                 |
	| Owner Email Address                    | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Owner First Name                       | PRO                                        |
	| Owner Last Name                        | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Partner First Line Support             | false                                      |
	| Product Type                           | New                                        |
	| Product Name                           | A Liferay DXP Product                      |
	| Project Name                           | Korpro - ${staticProjectName}              |
	| Renewal                                | false                                      |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Key             | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}          |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 1 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey1} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 2 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey2} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Sold By         | Liferay US                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Stage Name      | Closed Won                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Territory       | United States                              |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Type            | New Business                               |
	| Salesforce Owner User Key              | ${staticSalesforceOwnerUserKey}            |
	| Salesforce Project Key                 | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey}              |
	| Start Day                              | ${staticStartDay}                          |
	| Start Month                            | ${staticStartMonth}                        |
	| Start Year                             | ${staticStartYear}                         |
	| Subscription Level                     | Platinum                                   |
	| Version Number                         | 7.1                                        |
	And I wait for "10" seconds
	And I create an external link for the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | koroneikiautomotive |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                |
	| Entity Name | KoroneikiAutomotive |
	And I log into the provisioning homepage as "test@liferay.com" with password "kwSgiajslgb7ecsD"
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Korpro"
	And I click on the account with the name "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" on the provisioning index
	And I expand the side panel on the account details page
	And I click on the "External Links" side panel tab
	Then I should be able to view the account external link "Salesforce Account"
	And I should be able to view the account external link "Dossiera Account"
	And I should be able to view the account external link "Salesforce Project"
	And I should be able to view the account external link "koroneikiautomotive-KoroneikiAutomotive"
	When I click on the "History" tab
	Then the history entry in position number "5" with the field value "entityId" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Auto > Added External Link  |
	| Update Field Name           | entityId                    |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                         |
	| Update Field New Value      | ${staticDossieraAccountKey} |
	And the history entry in position number "5" with the field value "entityName" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Auto > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | entityName                 |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                        |
	| Update Field New Value      | account                    |
	And the history entry in position number "5" with the field value "domain" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Auto > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | domain                     |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                        |
	| Update Field New Value      | salesforce                 |
	And the history entry in position number "6" with the field value "entityId" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Auto > Added External Link  |
	| Update Field Name           | entityId                    |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                         |
	| Update Field New Value      | ${staticDossieraAccountKey} |
	And the history entry in position number "6" with the field value "entityName" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Auto > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | entityName                 |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                        |
	| Update Field New Value      | account                    |
	And the history entry in position number "6" with the field value "domain" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Auto > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | domain                     |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                        |
	| Update Field New Value      | dossiera                   |
	And the history entry in position number "7" with the field value "entityId" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Auto > Added External Link    |
	| Update Field Name           | entityId                      |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                           |
	| Update Field New Value      | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey} |
	And the history entry in position number "7" with the field value "entityName" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Auto > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | entityName                 |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                        |
	| Update Field New Value      | project                    |
	And the history entry in position number "7" with the field value "domain" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Auto > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | domain                     |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                        |
	| Update Field New Value      | salesforce                 |
	And the history entry in position number "11" with the field value "entityId" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki Admin > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | entityId                              |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                   |
	| Update Field New Value      | 1234                                  |
	And the history entry in position number "11" with the field value "entityName" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki Admin > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | entityName                            |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                   |
	| Update Field New Value      | KoroneikiAutomotive                   |
	And the history entry in position number "11" with the field value "domain" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki Admin > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | domain                                |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                   |
	| Update Field New Value      | koroneikiautomotive                   |

Scenario: View mapped external link
	Testing the ability to create a platinum subcription in Dossiera and adding a mapped external link and viewing the external link in the provisioning account details page 

	Given I generate several static variables for Provisioning
	And I generate a provisioning company name
	And I generate a provisioning project name
	And I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message on sandbox with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
	| Account Name                           | Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}              |
	| Address City                           | Diamond Bar                                |
	| Address Country                        | United States                              |
	| Address Postal Code                    | 91765                                      |
	| Address Region                         | California                                 |
	| Address Street                         | 456 Fake Street                            |
	| Contact Email Address                  | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Contact First Name                     | PRO                                        |
	| Contact Last Name                      | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Contact Role                           | Liferay Account Customer Role              |
	| Dossiera Account Key                   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey}                |
	| Dossiera Address Key 1                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey1}               |
	| Dossiera Address Key 2                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey2}               |
	| Dossiera Contact Key                   | ${staticDossieraContactKey}                |
	| Dossiera Project Key                   | ${staticDossieraProjectKey}                |
	| End Day                                | ${staticEndDay}                            |
	| End Month                              | ${staticEndMonth}                          |
	| End Year                               | ${staticEndYear}                           |
	| Industry                               | Automotive                                 |
	| Owner Email Address                    | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Owner First Name                       | PRO                                        |
	| Owner Last Name                        | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Partner First Line Support             | false                                      |
	| Product Type                           | New                                        |
	| Product Name                           | A Liferay DXP Product                      |
	| Project Name                           | Korpro - ${staticProjectName}              |
	| Renewal                                | false                                      |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Key             | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}          |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 1 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey1} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 2 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey2} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Sold By         | Liferay US                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Stage Name      | Closed Won                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Territory       | United States                              |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Type            | New Business                               |
	| Salesforce Owner User Key              | ${staticSalesforceOwnerUserKey}            |
	| Salesforce Project Key                 | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey}              |
	| Start Day                              | ${staticStartDay}                          |
	| Start Month                            | ${staticStartMonth}                        |
	| Start Year                             | ${staticStartYear}                         |
	| Subscription Level                     | Platinum                                   |
	| Version Number                         | 7.1                                        |
	And I wait for "10" seconds
	And I create an external link for the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | Koroneiki |
	| Entity Id   | 1234      |
	| Entity Name | Generic   |
	And I log into the provisioning homepage as "test@liferay.com" with password "kwSgiajslgb7ecsD"
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Korpro"
	And I click on the account with the name "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" on the provisioning index
	And I expand the side panel on the account details page
	And I click on the "External Links" side panel tab
	Then I should be able to view the account external link "Salesforce Account"
	And I should be able to view the account external link "Dossiera Account"
	And I should be able to view the account external link "Salesforce Project"
	And I should be able to view the account external link "Koroneiki-Generic" with the href "https://koroneiki.liferay.com/1234"
	When I click on the "History" tab
	And the history entry in position number "11" with the field value "entityId" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki Admin > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | entityId                              |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                   |
	| Update Field New Value      | 1234                                  |
	And the history entry in position number "11" with the field value "entityName" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki Admin > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | entityName                            |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                   |
	| Update Field New Value      | Generic                               |
	And the history entry in position number "11" with the field value "domain" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki Admin > Added External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | domain                                |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                   |
	| Update Field New Value      | Koroneiki                             |

Scenario: View removed external link
	Testing the ability to create a platinum subcription in Dossiera and adding and removing an external link and viewing the removal of the external link in the provisioning account details page 

	Given I generate several static variables for Provisioning
	And I generate a provisioning company name
	And I generate a provisioning project name
	And I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message on sandbox with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
	| Account Name                           | Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}              |
	| Address City                           | Diamond Bar                                |
	| Address Country                        | United States                              |
	| Address Postal Code                    | 91765                                      |
	| Address Region                         | California                                 |
	| Address Street                         | 456 Fake Street                            |
	| Contact Email Address                  | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Contact First Name                     | PRO                                        |
	| Contact Last Name                      | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Contact Role                           | Liferay Account Customer Role              |
	| Dossiera Account Key                   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey}                |
	| Dossiera Address Key 1                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey1}               |
	| Dossiera Address Key 2                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey2}               |
	| Dossiera Contact Key                   | ${staticDossieraContactKey}                |
	| Dossiera Project Key                   | ${staticDossieraProjectKey}                |
	| End Day                                | ${staticEndDay}                            |
	| End Month                              | ${staticEndMonth}                          |
	| End Year                               | ${staticEndYear}                           |
	| Industry                               | Automotive                                 |
	| Owner Email Address                    | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Owner First Name                       | PRO                                        |
	| Owner Last Name                        | Koroneiki1                                 |
	| Partner First Line Support             | false                                      |
	| Product Type                           | New                                        |
	| Product Name                           | A Liferay DXP Product                      |
	| Project Name                           | Korpro - ${staticProjectName}              |
	| Renewal                                | false                                      |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Key             | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}          |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 1 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey1} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 2 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey2} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Sold By         | Liferay US                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Stage Name      | Closed Won                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Territory       | United States                              |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Type            | New Business                               |
	| Salesforce Owner User Key              | ${staticSalesforceOwnerUserKey}            |
	| Salesforce Project Key                 | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey}              |
	| Start Day                              | ${staticStartDay}                          |
	| Start Month                            | ${staticStartMonth}                        |
	| Start Year                             | ${staticStartYear}                         |
	| Subscription Level                     | Platinum                                   |
	| Version Number                         | 7.1                                        |
	And I wait for "10" seconds
	And I create an external link for the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | koroneikiautomotive |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                |
	| Entity Name | KoroneikiAutomotive |
	And I delete an external link with the entity id "1234" on the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}"
	And I log into the provisioning homepage as "test@liferay.com" with password "kwSgiajslgb7ecsD"
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Korpro"
	And I click on the account with the name "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" on the provisioning index
	And I expand the side panel on the account details page
	And I click on the "External Links" side panel tab
	Then I should be able to view the account external link "Salesforce Account"
	And I should be able to view the account external link "Dossiera Account"
	And I should be able to view the account external link "Salesforce Project"
	And I should not be able to view the account external link "koroneikiautomotive-KoroneikiAutomotive"
	When I click on the "History" tab
	And the history entry in position number "12" with the field value "entityId" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki Admin > Deleted External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | entityId                                |
	| Update Field Original Value | 1234                                    |
	| Update Field New Value      | N/A                                     |
	And the history entry in position number "12" with the field value "entityName" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki Admin > Deleted External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | entityName                              |
	| Update Field Original Value | KoroneikiAutomotive                     |
	| Update Field New Value      | N/A                                     |
	And the history entry in position number "12" with the field value "domain" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki Admin > Deleted External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | domain                                  |
	| Update Field Original Value | koroneikiautomotive                     |
	| Update Field New Value      | N/A                                     |

