Scenario: View all removed external links
	Testing the ability to create a platinum subcription in Dossiera and adding and removing all external links and viewing the removal of all external links in the provisioning account details page 

	Given I generate several static variables for Provisioning
	And I generate a provisioning company name
	And I generate a provisioning project name
	And I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message on sandbox with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
